{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a6672371-0487-8914-ae21-1932334e6a7a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T17:24:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Um, I know it's after five, City Hall is closed, but they said this number was for the snow. Is this the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you've got the right one. This line stays open for storm issues in the evening. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I'm in a, um, a drive-through line right now, at the pharmacy. So if I get cut off, that's why. The car is moving up and I have you on the speaker. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. If we get disconnected I'll have your number if you give it to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0152."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two. Got it. So what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the fire hydrant. On my street. The plow came through after the, the storm, the one with the snow that turned to rain, last weekend. Sunday into Monday. And it, um. [pause] It pushed all the snow right up on the hydrant and now you can't see it at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the hydrant's buried under the plowed snow. Which street are you on, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gidley Street. Twenty-four Gidley. The hydrant is right in front, by my walk. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-four Gidley Street. And the hydrant is in front of that house, buried by the plow bank. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Right. It's, it's, um. [line breaks up] ...a big heavy pile. It was wet, and then it froze, so it's like a rock now. I can't dig it myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:21:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there. You said it froze hard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:22:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's frozen. Solid. All that rain and then the cold. Wicked heavy. I tried with a shovel and, no. I'm not going to do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, don't hurt yourself on that. I'll put in a request to get the hydrant cleared. I'll note it's packed and icy so they know to bring the right equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And, um, I wanted to ask. [pause] What was the other thing. Oh. The sand. The sidewalk and the end of my driveway are all ice. Could somebody bring sand? I'd like some sand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is that for the street, or for your own walkway and driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the street, mostly. It's slick right at the corner by me. And, well, if there's any I could get for the walk, that would be nice. I'm annoyed, honestly. They plow it in and then nobody comes back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll put the street down for sanding at that corner. For your own walk, I can't promise a delivery, but I'll note that you asked. Is the corner at a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:23:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, the car, I have to move. [crosstalk] Okay. It's, um, the corner of Gidley and, I'm trying to think. [pause] It's the corner right by my house. The one on the left, going up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I have twenty-four Gidley, so the crew can find it. I'll write the sand request for the slick spot nearest that address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:23:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's good. That's, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back. Twenty-four Gidley Street, Fifth Ward. Fire hydrant in front buried by plowed snow, now frozen hard. Sand requested for the icy corner by the house. Callback number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's all of it. Oh, they're, they're waving me up. I'm at the window. [pause] I'm sorry, what was I saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set, you don't need to say anything else. Go get your prescription. I'll send this over tonight so it's in the crew's list for the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, dear. I hope somebody comes soon. It's been two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It'll go in as soon as we hang up. You take care and be careful on those icy steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:24:45-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
